* trade - canja; jibri; basti;
* train - trene (vehicular sense); jonpoi (physically-joined-objects sense);crezenzu'e, rapcreze'a
* transport -  xe klama /xelkla, xe ka'a;se tcana?, "marce", "bevri"
* tray - palne
* tree - tricu
* trick - tcica, ticygau;
* trouble - raktu
* trousers - palku
* true - jetnu
* turn - carna, kruvi
* twist - torni; sometimes carna
* umbrella - santa (u'i)
* under - cnita; ni'a?
* unit - gradu
* up - ga'u; sort of galtu
* use - pilno
* value - vamji; ve vecnu, se jdima; steci
* verse - pemci; ??? (in sense delimited subset of text)
* very - mutce; in some contexts traji might be meant; carmi.
* vessel - vasru; bloti; kabri; blutu'u
* view - jvinu; se viska
* violent - ka vlile
* voice - voksa
* waiting - nu denpa/denpa; nu djabeipre (IOW waiting on people; waiter.)
* walk - cadzu
* wall - bitmu
* war - jamna
* warm - mligla or glare, depending on level of exaggeration.
* wash - lumci; flecu in sense 'wash of water/backwash'
* waste - festi, xaksu, vikmi
* watch - zgana, catlu; mencti; junla; ??? (in sense 'a watch/patrol'; some kind of zgaku'i. bilzgaku'i?)
* water - djacu
* wave - boxna
* wax - lakse
* way - pluta / ve pluta, ve muvdu,xe bevri
* weather - tcima
* week - jeftu. cf detri.
* weight - junta (not tilju, but it may be relevant.)
* well - xamgu, jinto, kanro
* west - vu'a, stici
* wet - cilmo
* wheel - xislu
* when - ca ma
* where - vi ma; (use of zo'u prenexes/reversing as in "X Ys, where Y is defined as.."), "bu'u ma" more often than "vi ma".
* while - cabna, ca, ca'o
* whistle - siclu / se siclu
* white - blabi
* who - ma (in appropriate place); ma kau (in appropriate place, eg gau ma kau)
* why - ki'u ma; mu'i ma; ri'a ma; ni'i ma, ja'e ma less often. also each with kau appended.
* wide - ganra
* will - te zukte; ??? (in sense used in 'will reading'), "ba"
* wind - brife
* window - canko
* wine - vanju
* wing - nalci
* winter - dunra
* wire - cilta; (in some contexts, skori might be more appropriate.)
* wise - prije
* with - tugni in some sense (see "together"), "se pi'o"
* woman - ninmu
* wood - mudri
* wool - sunla
* word - valsi
* work - various senses: gunka, briju, te jerna, jibri; also even se
* finti, se cukta
* worm - curnu
* wound - cagna [EXPERIMENTAL] in the 'A wound' sense.; xrani in the 'event wounding X' sense. - 
* writing - multiple senses -> different places of ciska
* wrong - jitfa; toldrani; te venfu; tolvu'e; palci?, se srera   whip - bikla (in 'action' sense); bikyxa'i (in 'object' sense)
* year - nanca .cf detri
* yellow - pelxu
* yes - go'i; je'e; ja'a; vi'o (and probably others; all different senses.)
* yesterday - prulamdei
* you - do (approximately.)
* young - citno